<div class="ga-shipping-page-wrapper" style="padding: 2rem 0; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-sans);">
  
  <!-- Editorial Page Header -->
  <div class="ga-shipping-header-editorial" style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 4rem auto 5rem auto; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ga-border-color); padding-bottom: 3.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; padding-right: 1.5rem;">
    <span class="ga-subtitle" style="color: var(--ga-gold-cream); font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">SAFE &amp; ASSURED HIMALAYAN LOGISTICS</span>
    <h1 class="ga-title" style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.4rem); font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
    <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
      From the pristine hills of Uttarakhand to your home, we take reasonable care in packing and shipping every order so that you receive authentic Pahadi purity in peak condition.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--ga-forest-green); font-weight: 500;">
      <span>📞 Support: <strong>+91 90272 48335</strong></span>
      <span>👤 Owner (Manisha Lohani): <strong>+91 72920 02260</strong></span>
      <span>✉️ <strong>gharaanganmani@gmail.com</strong></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Text-Based Policy Content -->
  <div class="ga-shipping-content-block" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto 6rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem;">
    
    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">1. Logistics Partners</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        We work with established logistics partners including <strong>Shiprocket, Delhivery, Blue Dart, Ekart, and Amazon Shipping Surface</strong>. The courier selected for an individual shipment may vary based on destination, serviceability, package characteristics, availability, and operational conditions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">2. Order Processing &amp; Pickup</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        We generally initiate the shipment/pickup process within <strong>24 hours</strong> of a successful order (in some cases, pickup is generated within only a few hours). Because Ghar Aangan operates from Uttarakhand and some operating locations are relatively remote, courier partners may sometimes take additional time to reach our pickup location. Pickup time can therefore be longer than the usual 24-hour expectation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">3. Delivery Timelines</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        For normal domestic shipments, customers can generally expect delivery within <strong>3–7 days</strong> after the order has been shipped/picked up. This is an estimated window, not an absolute guarantee. Remote locations, courier capacity, and destination serviceability may require additional time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">4. Possible Delivery Delays</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Delays may occur because of vehicle accidents, road blocks, landslides, severe weather, natural events, courier operational issues, network congestion, major festivals, public holidays, address/PIN-code issues, customer unavailability, or other unforeseen circumstances. We will make reasonable efforts to follow up with the logistics partner when a delay is reported.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">5. Shiprocket Quick</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Ghar Aangan may offer <strong>Shiprocket Quick</strong> for selected orders and serviceable locations, including selected metro and Delhi/NCR regions. Such faster delivery may require the order to be prepaid. Availability, charges, and estimated timelines depend on serviceability and operational availability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 6 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">6. Shipping Charges</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        Under normal circumstances, Ghar Aangan generally charges approximately <strong>₹100 per domestic delivery</strong>. The actual charge can vary by state, city/PIN code, package characteristics, courier service, and active promotions.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        We may offer free shipping on selected products, minimum order values, or festive promotions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 7 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">7. Packaging: Glass &amp; Steel</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Our <strong>550 ml, 1 litre, and 2 litre</strong> ghee products are packed in glass jars. Our <strong>5 litre</strong> ghee product is packed in a steel Dolchi. Glass is delicate, so we use protective packaging and take reasonable care while preparing every shipment. However, courier handling is outside our direct control.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 8 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">8. Tracking &amp; Address Accuracy</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        <strong>Tracking:</strong> After the courier shipment is generated and picked up, tracking information is available through Shiprocket and/or the relevant courier. Courier scans can occasionally update with a delay or show an estimated status that later changes. If tracking appears stuck or unusual, contact us and we will follow up.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        <strong>Address &amp; RTO:</strong> Customers are responsible for providing a complete and accurate delivery address, PIN code, and contact number. Incorrect/incomplete details or unavailability can cause delays, failed attempts, or Return to Origin (RTO). Customers should reasonably remain available for delivery calls.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 9 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">9. International Delivery</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        International delivery is an ongoing goal for Ghar Aangan. When international shipping is enabled, the usual indicative delivery time is around <strong>15–18 days</strong> (indicative charges approx <strong>₹800–₹1,000 per delivery</strong>, subject to destination, courier, and applicable charges). Customs clearance, destination regulations, documentation, and weather may cause delays. Applicable duties or taxes imposed by the destination country apply separately where legally required.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 10 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">10. Cash on Delivery (COD) Status</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        <strong>COD is currently disabled</strong> on Ghar Aangan's website. This may change in the future depending on operational requirements, delivery performance, and customer demand. If COD is enabled again, its applicable terms and availability will be displayed on the website.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

